// M0.9 vertical slice — variant prefab. The `of "Mob"` base lives in
// mob.prefab.etch: E2-B resolves it CROSS-FILE (E1791 clean) — this is the
// cross-file prefab-base resolution the slice exercises. The `Health` reference
// is E1793 under validateProject (cross-file type-import = Phase 1 resolver
